        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akawaambia, “Watu wa nyakati hizi huoa na kuolewa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lakini wale ambao Mungu atawawezesha kushiriki ule wakati wa ufufuo, hawataoa wala kuolewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama hakika, hawawezi kufa tena, kwa sababu watakuwa kama malaika, na ni watoto wa Mungu kwa vile wamefufuliwa katika wafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini, kwamba kuna kufufuka kutoka kwa wafu, hata Mose alithibitisha jambo hilo katika Maandiko Matakatifu. Katika sehemu ya Maandiko Matakatifu juu ya kile kichaka kilichokuwa kinawaka moto, anamtaja Bwana kama Mungu wa Abrahamu, Mungu wa Isaka na Mungu wa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, yeye si Mungu wa wafu, bali ni Mungu wa wale walio hai; maana kwake wote wanaishi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
